			<div class="content" id="post-content-4006922">
									

<p>This has been quite the journey! As a note, Derps picked 4117 because it's been 117 days since we initially started the collab sandbox for this work.</p>
<p>ETA: of course, big, big thanks to everyone who read this in chat! We really appreciate your time and enthusiasm. :D</p>
<p>I remember seeing the first draft in the forums and really liking the idea of a musical table connecting people through music. Basically being like the ultimate wingman, but for friends and not just dates.</p>
<p>As someone who generally prefers to eat alone, but also has a lot of great memories of eating meals with a bunch of friends (usually takeout, lol) I feel like it's important to have people you can just chill with sometimes. Just good to know that there's someone out there who might be thinking of you sometime in their days, when they hear that one song.</p>

							</div>

								
